      "text": "Monopoly's dice once had diamond spots.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "hook"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Sidney Mobell was a jeweler in San Francisco.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "eternity",
        "stone": "emerald",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A San Francisco jeweler",
        "stones": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Each year, he made a jeweled everyday object to stand out.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "bracelet",
        "stone": "aquamarine",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A yearly stunt"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He once made a gold sardine can.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "ring",
        "stone": "pink",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A gold sardine can",
        "cut": "cushion"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Another was a gold mousetrap with a diamond cheese wedge.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "necklace",
        "stone": "emerald",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A diamond cheese wedge",
        "cut": "emerald"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In 1988, he heard about the World Monopoly Tournament in London.",
      "say": "In nineteen eighty eight, he heard about the World Monopoly Tournament in London.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "real",
        "src": "514-monopoly-s-dice-once-had-diamond-spots-0.jpg",
        "fit": "card",
        "label": "A Monopoly board",
        "credit": "Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So he built a Monopoly set in gold.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "earrings",
        "stone": "morganite",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A set in gold",
        "cut": "pear"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The board is gold plated, and the pieces are solid gold.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
